    "updated_at": "2022-09-05T14:16:07Z",
    "body": "> Shouldn't the \"option\" and \"optgroup\" (for inclusion in \"select\" or \"datagroup\" elements) be reviewed to make them more flexible?\r\n\r\nThere is a (early draft) proposal from the [open UI group](https://github.com/openui/open-ui) for changed behaviour here: https://open-ui.org/components/select#content-not-allowed-within-the-anatomy",
