    "body": "Note, in the past (I think ~15 years ago) `<option>` with an `<img>` inside it was used to trick the popup of the `<select>` to look like the desktop of the operating system. It was very convincing looking and by using right kind of event listeners it was possible to get at least some sensitive data from the user.",
